{\b RDP Monitor}\par
\par
RDP Monitor runs as a Windows service on this computer. It records Remote Desktop (RDP) connections from the Windows event logs and sends email notifications through the SMTP server configured by your administrator.\par
\par
Data stays on this computer in C:\\ProgramData\\RDP Monitor. The only network traffic in normal operation is email to the configured SMTP server. Update checks contact the configured GitHub or GitLab server only when an administrator clicks Check for updates.\par
\par
This software is provided by your IT department for authorized monitoring of this computer. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.\par
